sequenceDiagram
    participant SM as Session Manager
    participant AC as Agent Core
    participant SR as Skill Registry
    participant TR as Tool Registry
    participant RAG as RAG Pipeline
    participant KB as Knowledge Base

    SM->>AC: Start session (assessment_type: "web_app")
    AC->>SR: Request skill pack for "web_app"
    SR->>SR: Look up manifest: skill_web_app.yaml

    Note over SR: Manifest contains:<br/>- methodology steps<br/>- allowed tools<br/>- knowledge namespaces<br/>- risk policy overrides<br/>- prompt templates<br/>- eval scenarios

    SR-->>AC: Return SkillPack object

    AC->>TR: Load tools from skill allow-list
    Note over TR: Tools: httpx, nuclei,<br/>ffuf, sqlmap, nikto,<br/>burp_api, custom_crawl

    TR->>TR: Validate tool versions and sandbox profiles
    TR-->>AC: ToolSet ready

    AC->>RAG: Configure retrieval namespaces
    Note over RAG: Namespaces:<br/>- owasp_top_10<br/>- owasp_wstg<br/>- cwe_web<br/>- redfox_web_playbook

    RAG->>KB: Load embedding indices for namespaces
    KB-->>RAG: Indices loaded

    RAG-->>AC: RAG configured

    AC->>AC: Initialize engagement state
    AC->>AC: Load methodology from skill pack
    AC->>AC: Begin reasoning loop with skill context

    Note over AC: Skill pack loaded.<br/>Agent now has:<br/>1. Domain methodology<br/>2. Curated tool set<br/>3. Relevant knowledge<br/>4. Risk policy<br/>5. Prompt templates
